    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move from tile to tile to find the exit in two distinct worlds. Each move you make in the first world is mirrored in the second, creating a challenging puzzle that demands strategy and careful thinking to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/dfed648c011f4f7f475bd5a7e8a3640b.poster.avif?t=1734687976\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/dfed648c011f4f7f475bd5a7e8a3640b.webm?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/dfed648c011f4f7f475bd5a7e8a3640b.mp4?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillfully utilize the different movement modes to make your actions possible in both worlds simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/6f1c37c01cd689e255585bde56f6b2b2.poster.avif?t=1734687976\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/6f1c37c01cd689e255585bde56f6b2b2.webm?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/6f1c37c01cd689e255585bde56f6b2b2.mp4?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles and explore tiles with unique features that can shift your position between two worlds. Every move you make will be vital to solving the puzzle and finding the way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/e94dbdad605a4d16e27c1cb21ab59d55.poster.avif?t=1734687976\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/e94dbdad605a4d16e27c1cb21ab59d55.webm?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/e94dbdad605a4d16e27c1cb21ab59d55.mp4?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into 50 unique maps with progressively challenging levels.</p>",
