o solving the puzzle and finding the way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/e94dbdad605a4d16e27c1cb21ab59d55.poster.avif?t=1734687976\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/e94dbdad605a4d16e27c1cb21ab59d55.webm?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367700/extras/e94dbdad605a4d16e27c1cb21ab59d55.mp4?t=1734687976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into 50 unique maps with progressively challenging levels.</p>",
